    "devanagari": "यामिमां पुष्पितां वाचं प्रवदन्त्यविपश्चितः। वेदवादरताः पार्थ नान्यदस्तीति वादिनः॥2.42॥",
    "iast": "yāmimāṃ puṣpitāṃ vācṃ pravadantyavipaścitḥ vedavādaratāḥ pārtha nānyadastīti vādinḥ",
    "conceptIds": ["gita-sankhya"],
    "interpretiveNotes": [{"note": "Kashmir Series of Texts and Studies No. LXIV (1943): Bhagavadgītā with Sarvatobhadra of Rājānaka Rāmakantha, ed. Madhusudan Kaul Shastri; Sanskrit-only source, English rendering original to this project."}],
    "translation": "Flowery words prattle the unwise, Veda-delighting, saying naught else exists.",
