    "interpretiveNotes": [{"note": "Kashmir Series of Texts and Studies No. LXIV (1943): Bhagavadgītā with Sarvatobhadra of Rājānaka Rāmakantha, ed. Madhusudan Kaul Shastri; Sanskrit-only source, English rendering original to this project."}, {"note": "Rāmakantha pāṭha: Rāmakantha: karmaṇy astv adhikāras te (vs karmaṇy evādhikāras te)."}],
